# Personal Shell Modules

This repository contains my personal Bash and PowerShell modules
used to extend interactive shell sessions with common functionality:
- logging
- internationalization
- environment and Python management
- developer utilities

## Supported environments
- Bash (Linux / WSL)
- PowerShell 7+

## Structure
- bash/        → Bash modules and configuration
- powershell/  → PowerShell modules and profile scripts
- autohotkey/  → Windows automation